{"2022330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Riflemen", "steam_appid": 2022330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2521030], "detailed_description": "The Riflemen is a fun, fast-paced low poly first-person shooter where matches are short and full of action! All players start with bolt-action rifles that they don’t need to reload. Players can customize their weapons and characters to get the look they want.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY LIKE YOU WANT</h2><br>The Riflemen offers a variety of game modes to suit your playstyle. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Go head-to-head in a classic fight for elimination in <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>.<br></li><li> Work together with your squad to capture and hold objectives in <strong>Domination</strong>.<br></li><li> Feeling resourceful? <strong>Scavenger</strong> throws you into a world with limited ammo, forcing you to adapt and utilize dropped ammunition from fallen enemies and allies to survive.<br></li><li> For a truly tactical challenge, dive into <strong>Secure &amp; Survive</strong>, a round-based battle where securing valuable cargo or eliminating the opposing team is your objective.</li></ul><br><strong>You can disable the supply drops in Barebones to get only bolt-action rifle action or make it even more competitive with the Hardcore type where every hit will be an insta-kill!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/6af748fc12fcba86397a0cc0e7a04a45.poster.avif?t=1755241839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/6af748fc12fcba86397a0cc0e7a04a45.webm?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/6af748fc12fcba86397a0cc0e7a04a45.mp4?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUNPLAY</h2><br>The Riflemen is a battle of skills and a true trial of friendships. Aim, shoot, reload, and repeat — no automatic weapons, only tough-ass action. Headshots make your opponents go sleepy-time at once and supply drops might bring you a shotgun, a sniper rifle, a bazooka, frag grenades, rapid fire pistol, mines or even a gunto sword! <i>Whew, now that's a lot of fire power!</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> All players start with bolt-action rifles &amp; knives<br></li><li> Headshots kill with one shot<br></li><li> No manual reloading is needed</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/fe1a4c9950c2b565f8aeb2e30de58ee3.poster.avif?t=1755241839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/fe1a4c9950c2b565f8aeb2e30de58ee3.webm?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/fe1a4c9950c2b565f8aeb2e30de58ee3.mp4?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><br>The Riflemen isn't just about raw skill – it's about expressing yourself on the battlefield. As you progress through over 100 levels, you'll unlock a variety of character and weapon skins, allowing you to create a soldier that's uniquely yours.  Don't stop there!  Personalize your arsenal with a variety of wood and metal finishes, crafting a weapon that reflects your playstyle.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> With the DLC you'll be able to unlock 3 times more cosmetics! Become a legend who walks the line between lethality and sheer style.</li></ul><br><i>In The Riflemen, the battlefield is your canvas, and the bolt-action rifle your brush. Every shot a stroke, every kill a masterpiece.</i>", "about_the_game": "The Riflemen is a fun, fast-paced low poly first-person shooter where matches are short and full of action! All players start with bolt-action rifles that they don’t need to reload. Players can customize their weapons and characters to get the look they want.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY LIKE YOU WANT</h2><br>The Riflemen offers a variety of game modes to suit your playstyle. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Go head-to-head in a classic fight for elimination in <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>.<br></li><li> Work together with your squad to capture and hold objectives in <strong>Domination</strong>.<br></li><li> Feeling resourceful? <strong>Scavenger</strong> throws you into a world with limited ammo, forcing you to adapt and utilize dropped ammunition from fallen enemies and allies to survive.<br></li><li> For a truly tactical challenge, dive into <strong>Secure &amp; Survive</strong>, a round-based battle where securing valuable cargo or eliminating the opposing team is your objective.</li></ul><br><strong>You can disable the supply drops in Barebones to get only bolt-action rifle action or make it even more competitive with the Hardcore type where every hit will be an insta-kill!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/6af748fc12fcba86397a0cc0e7a04a45.poster.avif?t=1755241839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/6af748fc12fcba86397a0cc0e7a04a45.webm?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/6af748fc12fcba86397a0cc0e7a04a45.mp4?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUNPLAY</h2><br>The Riflemen is a battle of skills and a true trial of friendships. Aim, shoot, reload, and repeat — no automatic weapons, only tough-ass action. Headshots make your opponents go sleepy-time at once and supply drops might bring you a shotgun, a sniper rifle, a bazooka, frag grenades, rapid fire pistol, mines or even a gunto sword! <i>Whew, now that's a lot of fire power!</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> All players start with bolt-action rifles &amp; knives<br></li><li> Headshots kill with one shot<br></li><li> No manual reloading is needed</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/fe1a4c9950c2b565f8aeb2e30de58ee3.poster.avif?t=1755241839\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/fe1a4c9950c2b565f8aeb2e30de58ee3.webm?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022330/extras/fe1a4c9950c2b565f8aeb2e30de58ee3.mp4?t=1755241839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><br>The Riflemen isn't just about raw skill – it's about expressing yourself on the battlefield. As you progress through over 100 levels, you'll unlock a variety of character and weapon skins, allowing you to create a soldier that's uniquely yours.  Don't stop there!  Personalize your arsenal with a variety of wood and metal finishes, crafting a weapon that reflects your playstyle.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> With the DLC you'll be able to unlock 3 times more cosmetics! Become a legend who walks the line between lethality and sheer style.</li></ul><br><i>In The Riflemen, the battlefield is your canvas, and the bolt-action rifle your brush. Every shot a stroke, every kill a masterpiece.</i>", "short_description": "Multiplayer first-person shooter with classic WW2 bolt-action rifles. Tight battles between two teams with up to 5 players in each, lots of unique arenas, game-changing weapon drops, differ